{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39830","headline":"赵侍郎看红白牡丹因寄杨状头赞图 · 殷文圭","name":"赵侍郎看红白牡丹因寄杨状头赞图","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"迟开都爲让羣芳，贵地栽成对玉堂。\n红艳褭烟疑欲语，素华映月只闻香。\n翦裁偏得东风意，淡薄似矜西子粧。\n雅称花中爲首冠，年年长占断春光。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"殷文圭","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39830.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39830","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}